WEBVTT

00:05:28.329 --> 00:05:32.509
is when you begin a new type of money
and a new type of credit.

00:05:32.956 --> 00:05:35.480
That began in 1945.

00:05:35.504 --> 00:05:40.035
The new world order
at the end of World War II,

00:05:40.059 --> 00:05:42.584
and with the Bretton Woods
monetary system,

00:05:42.608 --> 00:05:47.123
created a new monetary system
in 1945, a new money.

00:05:47.147 --> 00:05:49.522
So they wiped out,
pretty much, the old money,

00:05:49.546 --> 00:05:51.315
or they largely disposed of it,

00:05:51.339 --> 00:05:52.664
and they began anew.

00:05:52.688 --> 00:05:54.196
And that's the new world order,

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:56.268
which was the American world order,

00:05:56.292 --> 00:05:57.560
and we have seen it,

00:05:57.584 --> 00:06:02.149
and still, 70 percent of the money
and credit that exists in the economy